  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4090,
      "text": "Who is then more unjust than he who tells lies about Allah and rejects the truth when it comes to him? Is there no abode for the disbelievers in Hell?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4091,
      "text": "But the one who came with the truth [i.e., the prophet] and [those who] believed in it, it is they who are the righteous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4092,
      "text": "They will have with their Lord whatever they wish for. Such is the reward of those who do good.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4093,
      "text": "And Allah will absolve them of their worst deeds and reward them according to the best of what they used to do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4094,
      "text": "Is Allah not sufficient for His slave? Yet they frighten you with those [whom they worship] besides Him. Whoever Allah causes to stray, there is none to guide him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4095,
      "text": "And whoever Allah guides, none can lead him astray. Is not Allah All-Mighty, Capable of Retribution?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4096,
      "text": "If you ask them who created the heavens and earth, they will surely say, “Allah.” Say, “Then tell me about those whom you supplicate besides Allah; if Allah wills to harm me, can they remove His harm? Or if He wills mercy for me, can they withhold His mercy?” Say, “Allah is sufficient for me; in Him alone do the reliant put their trust.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 24,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 462,
      "ruku": 399,
      "hizbQuarter": 185,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4097,
      "text": "Say, “O my people, carry on as you are, and so will I. You will come to know",
      "surah": {
        "number": 39,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّمَرِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zumar",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Groups",
        "numberOfAyahs": 75,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 24,
